    "While the switch is on, it asks macOS not to sleep. Turn it off or quit, and every request is released. Energy settings and sleep timers stay as they are.": "Mientras el interruptor esté activo, evita que macOS entre en reposo. Al apagarlo o salir de la app, se restauran tus ajustes de energía originales.",
